1789280212.92005,"turn_id":"01a09967-6f68-7451-8bfe-9712d735afe3"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 4.8 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"144:              \u003cli\u003e\u003cbutton onClick={() =\u003e onCompare(m.interval)}\u003e\u003cspan\u003e{cue ? 3 : m.evidence.length ? 2 : 1}\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFind similar incidents across runs\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cArrowUpRight size={12}/\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n?? .cursor/\n?? .factory/\n?? .gemini/\n?? .github/\n?? .opencode/\n?? .pi/\n381d4df Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into codex/incident-cohorts\n\nb9600ec merge: integrate baseline comparison and CNN endpoint\n\n88c537a Merge pull request #24 from ukafkasyali/bugfix/bosch-onboarding-source-root\nfix(data-ingestion): complete Bosch onboarding preset\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"\n\u003e robot-observability-frontend@0.1.0 test\n\u003e vitest run\n\n\n RUN  v4.1.11 /Users/sametdegirmenci/Downloads/ysamet/frontend\n\n\n Test Files  16 passed (16)\n      Tests  94 passed (94)\n   Start at  08:16:48\n   Duration  574ms (transform 1.14s, setup 0ms, import 1.82s, tests 230ms, environment 1ms)\n\n\n\u003e robot-observability-frontend@0.1.0 build\n\u003e tsc -b \u0026\u0026 vite build\n\nvite v6.4.3 building for production...\ntransforming...\n✓ 1615 modules transformed.\nrendering chunks...\ncomputing gzip size...\ndist/index.html                       0.59 kB │ gzip:   0.37 kB\ndist/assets/index-pbbjl0D4.css       76.90 kB │ gzip:  14.96 kB\ndist/assets/index-C-mxgbQ-.js       380.78 kB │ gzip: 116.14 kB\ndist/assets/RobotPanel-Db9cI-tg.js  523.24 kB │ gzip: 132.37 kB\n\n(!) Some chunks are larger than 500 kB after minification. Consider:\n- Using dynamic import() to code-split the application\n- Use build.rollupOptions.output.manualChunks to improve chunking: https://rollupjs.org/configuration-options/#output-manualchunks\n- Adjust chunk size limit for this warning via build.chunkSizeWarningLimit.\n✓ built in 941ms\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"test_rejects_incomplete_evaluation (test_release.ReleaseTests.test_rejects_incomplete_evaluation) ... ok\ntest_rejects_unsafe_or_extra_checkpoint_state (test_release.ReleaseTests.test_rejects_unsafe_or_extra_checkpoint_state) ... ok\ntest_stages_immutable_checkpoint_and_config (test_release.ReleaseTests.test_stages_immutable_checkpoint_and_config) ... ok\ntest_normalizes_with_sample_std_and_constant_channel_is_finite (test_runtime.InputPreparationTests.test_normalizes_with_sample_std_and_constant_channel_is_finite) ... ok\ntest_preserves_order_count_and_no_targets (test_runtime.InputPreparationTests.test_preserves_order_count_and_no_targets) ... ok\ntest_rejects_channel_order_and_missing_values (test_runtime.InputPreparationTests.test_rejects_channel_order_and_missing_values) ... ok\ntest_rejects_future_boundary_and_unaligned_series (test_runtime.InputPreparationTests.test_rejects_future_boundary_and_unaligned_series) ... ok\ntest_rejects_wrong_shape_missing_sample_and_bad_cadence (test_runtime.InputPreparationTests.test_rejects_wrong_shape_missing_sample_and_bad_cadence) ... ok\ntest_robust_normalization_uses_stable_joint_identity (test_runtime.InputPreparationTests.test_robust_normalization_uses_stable_joint_identity) ... ok\ntest_routes_operator_questions_to_trained_contracts (test_runtime.InputPreparationTests.test_routes_operator_questions_to_trained_contracts) ... ok\ntest_unknown_preprocessing_fails (test_runtime.InputPreparationTests.test_unknown_preprocessing_fails) ... ok\ntest_actual_fixture_catalog_and_frontend_default_query (test_server.ServerTests.test_actual_fixture_catalog_and_frontend_default_query) ... ERROR\ntest_actual_runtime_stream_and_no_publisher_labels (test_server.ServerTests.test_actual_runtime_stream_and_no_publisher_labels) ... ERROR\ntest_assistant_orchestrates_measurement_and_opentslm (test_server.ServerTests.test_assistant_orchestrates_measurement_and_opentslm) ... ERROR\ntest_ba