{"timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:37:48.205Z","ordinal":14914,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a09736-d5c6-7cc3-a099-0521c0b02bd2","turn_id":"01a09973-2c14-7021-8bb8-3bdcb42353b2","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa644ba328887d2a056debb35bd010e","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Implemented and verified:\n\n- **PR #23 merged:** cross-run incident matching and cohorts.\n- **PR #26 ready:** automatic predicted-onset jump, joint highlighting, and labeled signal cue.\n- Simplified data-source UI with KUKA and FactoryBench presets.\n- Integrated main’s complete sourcing → approval → ingestion → TimeNet workflow.\n- Local stack is running at **http://127.0.0.1:5173/**.\n\nValidation: **112 frontend, 83 ingestion, 99 sourcing, and 29 inference tests passed.**\n\n[PR #26 is clean and mergeable](https://github.com/ukafkasyali/ysamet/pull/26). The coherent demo story is now:\n\n> Detect the incident → explain when and which joints reacted → inspect exact evidence → find repeats across runs → export a reviewable handoff."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1789281466222,"completed_at_ms":1789281468205}}
