{"timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:39:27.328Z","ordinal":14977,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a09736-d5c6-7cc3-a099-0521c0b02bd2","turn_id":"01a0997d-e59a-7ed3-9008-5472efcdac29","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa6451e57cc87d2976aa74a7bb706de","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I’m continuing. The new repository guide says the submission is frozen by default, but your explicit request reopens model exploration. I’ll treat a FactoryBench run as an experiment with hard gates: it must use real temporal input, finish a held-out evaluation, and improve the story without replacing canary-v4 or disturbing the shared service."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1789281566428,"completed_at_ms":1789281567328}}
