{"timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:40:07.377Z","ordinal":15003,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a09736-d5c6-7cc3-a099-0521c0b02bd2","turn_id":"01a0997d-e59a-7ed3-9008-5472efcdac29","item":{"type":"Reasoning","id":"rs_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa645418d9487d2b8c6c82e51d0b84f","summary_text":["**Evaluating GPU state and training setup**\n\nIt’s interesting that the GPU is idle, but it looks like the inference might still be using the CPU, showing no CUDA loads right now. The tmux command indicates that CUDA is configured, but the GPU memory isn't loading anything. I should check if the health is ready and maybe confirm the current config. It seems there’s no training process running on the H100, so I need to consider how to handle the dataset for FactoryBench."],"raw_content":[]},"started_at_ms":1789281601588,"completed_at_ms":1789281607377}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:40:07.380Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"id":"rs_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa645418d9487d2b8c6c82e51d0b84f","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0997d-e59a-7ed3-9008-5472efcdac29"},"summary":[{"text":"**Evaluating GPU state and training setup**\n\nIt’s interesting that the GPU is idle, but it looks like the inference might still be using the CPU, showing no CUDA loads right now. The tmux command indicates that CUDA is configured, but the GPU memory isn't loading anything. I should check if the health is ready and maybe confirm the current config. It seems there’s no training process running on the H100, so I need to consider how to handle the dataset for FactoryBench.","type":"summary_text"}],"type":"reasoning"}}
