{"timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:45:13.608Z","ordinal":15259,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a09983-4b08-7a72-83cc-18c34569e6b4","author":"/root/factorybench_loader","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/factorybench_loader\nPayload:\nFeasible as a separate FactoryBench L1 canary.\n\n- Parse numeric channels directly from FactoryBench contexts; preserve A/B series separately.\n- Group splits by connected episode components, since comparison rows link two episodes. QA-level splitting leaks.\n- Train on full L1, not the 572-item Lite set.\n- Use exact FactoryBench short answers and official deterministic scorer.\n- Select checkpoints by validation score and coverage.\n- Require zero-signal/time-shuffle degradation to prove temporal use.\n- Keep canary-v4 and the live service untouched.\n\nMain blockers: full L1 availability/checksums, changing dataset layouts, license inconsistency, and verifying no episode overlap. I sent the detailed file-level design to the coordinating agent."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0997d-e59a-7ed3-9008-5472efcdac29","create_time":1789281913.608921}}}
