{"timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:45:20.666Z","ordinal":15264,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a09983-669a-7953-a5a5-93c5780546be","author":"/root/nebius_probe","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/nebius_probe\nPayload:\nNebius is ready for isolated training:\n\n- H100 80GB idle, 1.1TB free disk, 191GB RAM available.\n- Live canary-v4 remains healthy and CPU-resident.\n- Public GitHub/Hugging Face/PyPI access works.\n- Local Llama backbone and HAR warm-start adapter are available.\n\nMain blockers are the FactoryBench adapter/scorer and a small local-checkpoint loader change. I sent the parent agent the exact safe launch plan and artifact hashes."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0997d-e59a-7ed3-9008-5472efcdac29","create_time":1789281920.666846}}}
