{"timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:47:39.718Z","ordinal":15365,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a09736-d5c6-7cc3-a099-0521c0b02bd2","turn_id":"01a0997d-e59a-7ed3-9008-5472efcdac29","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa6470957a087d2af77faba1e0599c4","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"We found a real path forward:\n\n- FactoryBench has **15,321 L1 examples from 4,309 real robot episodes**, not a toy dataset.\n- A random split would badly leak episodes, so I built the experiment around connected episode groups.\n- The Nebius H100 is idle and ready.\n- I’m implementing a separate FactoryBench OpenTSLM canary now. It will first run a 32-example fit/ablation gate, then train only if it proves it uses the signal.\n- Your existing canary-v4 and demo remain untouched.\n\nThis won’t replace today’s core demo. If it works, it gives us the stronger claim: **the same temporal model approach transfers from KUKA collision forensics to broader industrial robot questions.**"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1789282057372,"completed_at_ms":1789282059718}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:47:39.719Z","ordinal":15366,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa6470957a087d2af77faba1e0599c4","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"We found a real path forward:\n\n- FactoryBench has **15,321 L1 examples from 4,309 real robot episodes**, not a toy dataset.\n- A random split would badly leak episodes, so I built the experiment around connected episode groups.\n- The Nebius H100 is idle and ready.\n- I’m implementing a separate FactoryBench OpenTSLM canary now. It will first run a 32-example fit/ablation gate, then train only if it proves it uses the signal.\n- Your existing canary-v4 and demo remain untouched.\n\nThis won’t replace today’s core demo. If it works, it gives us the stronger claim: **the same temporal model approach transfers from KUKA collision forensics to broader industrial robot questions.**"}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0997d-e59a-7ed3-9008-5472efcdac29","content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}}}
