{"timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:52:01.482Z","ordinal":15551,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a09736-d5c6-7cc3-a099-0521c0b02bd2","turn_id":"01a09989-5963-7ac2-896e-62cf4245c0ce","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa6480f28f487d296eab164eef4e662","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Yes—this helps the story **if we label it correctly**:\n\n- KUKA remains the audited benchmark and working product demo.\n- FactoryBench becomes a **cross-dataset transfer experiment**: can the same OpenTSLM approach learn broader industrial robot questions across 4,309 episodes?\n- We can benchmark it against the untouched HAR warm start and signal ablations on the exact same validation split.\n- It strengthens motivation and generality, but only if the fine-tuned model beats warm start and worsens when signals are removed/shuffled.\n\nThe fit probe is running now. One H100 is enough for this gate; if it passes, I’ll use parallel compute for the full run and a matched baseline instead of wasting instances early."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1789282319190,"completed_at_ms":1789282321482}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:52:01.483Z","ordinal":15552,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa6480f28f487d296eab164eef4e662","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Yes—this helps the story **if we label it correctly**:\n\n- KUKA remains the audited benchmark and working product demo.\n- FactoryBench becomes a **cross-dataset transfer experiment**: can the same OpenTSLM approach learn broader industrial robot questions across 4,309 episodes?\n- We can benchmark it against the untouched HAR warm start and signal ablations on the exact same validation split.\n- It strengthens motivation and generality, but only if the fine-tuned model beats warm start and worsens when signals are removed/shuffled.\n\nThe fit probe is running now. One H100 is enough for this gate; if it passes, I’ll use parallel compute for the full run and a matched baseline instead of wasting instances early."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a09989-5963-7ac2-896e-62cf4245c0ce","content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}}}
