{"timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:54:57.389Z","ordinal":15669,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a09736-d5c6-7cc3-a099-0521c0b02bd2","turn_id":"01a09989-5963-7ac2-896e-62cf4245c0ce","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa648bfb84087d2bc6290551e85c5a5","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The first two startup attempts found real adapter bugs and I fixed both. The third H100 launch was blocked by the automatic approval reviewer because `AGENTS.md` still says a teammate owns the GPU, even though the VM currently shows **0 MiB / 0%** and you authorized extra compute.\n\nI’ll finish and push the isolated experiment code now. Then I need one explicit answer: **may I start the FactoryBench fit probe on the currently idle H100?**\n\nAutomatic approval review rejected that exact launch because it interpreted the repository’s stale GPU-reservation note as higher risk than the live `nvidia-smi` evidence."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1789282495802,"completed_at_ms":1789282497389}}
