al argument as a text in a json or yaml format which will be converted to the corresponding request structure.               \n                                                                                                                                                              \n  nebius compute v1 instance list '                                                                                                                           \n  {                                                                                                                                                           \n    \"page_size\": 0,                                                                                                                                           \n    \"page_token\": \"\",                                                                                                                                         \n    \"parent_id\": \"\"                                                                                                                                           \n  }                                                                                                                                                           \n  '                                                                                                                                                           \n\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"\n\u001b[1m\u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[0m  \u001b[1mNAME\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                                                                              \n      \u001b[1mnebius profile\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                    